{"lean_source":"-- Unsupported domain: no faithful executable proposal can be expressed in the registered frontend for these frozen obligations.\n","formalization":{"status":"unsupported_domain","reason":"Adding the required lean_source field repairs the response envelope, but cannot supply a faithful contract within the registered executable language. No obligations are claimed discharged.","gaps":[{"obligations":["D1","O4","O5","O6","I1"],"detail":"The typed AST lacks a nullable integer sort and nullable-value elimination with the required JSON integer-or-null representation. Result constructors do not establish that representation."},{"obligations":["O2","O6"],"detail":"Sorting is explicitly unsupported, and the grammar has no lexicographic string comparison. It cannot specify and implement the required ordered distinct group names for arbitrary input."},{"obligations":["O3","O6"],"detail":"The grammar has no range generation, recursion, or other operation that constructs an arbitrarily long bucket progression from the integer start, end, and width fields."},{"obligations":["O1","R1"],"detail":"The formula grammar does not express the required Python file location, permitted dependencies, or absence of observable side effects and external I/O."}],"preserved_obligations":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6","O7","I1","R1"],"required_resolution":"Extend the registered executable frontend to support the actual nullable schema, lexicographic group ordering, bucket generation, and implementation constraints. Opaque Lean cannot satisfy the selected Python TESTED assurance boundary."},"obligations":{},"witness_obligations":{}}